OL,3,AMore high winds hit parts of UK as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo clean-up continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong winds are expected to continue
OL,7,Facross Scotland and parts of Northern
OL,8,FIreland on Tuesday, after Storm Boelo
OL,9,Fbrought flooding and power cuts to
OL,10,Fthousands over the weekend.
OL,12,FWhile conditions are set to improve for
OL,13,Fmuch of the UK after a wet and windy
OL,14,Fmorning, clean-up efforts could be
OL,15,Fhampered elsewhere - including in
OL,16,FScotland, where a third of a month's
OL,17,Frain fell during the storm.
OL,19,FThe Energy Networks Association (ENA)
OL,20,Fsaid almost 8,000 people were still
OL,21,Fwithout power after more than 800,000
OL,22,Fexperienced cuts.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
