OL,3,AMore high winds hit parts of UK as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo clean-up continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men were killed by falling trees
OL,7,Fduring the storm on Sunday - a man in
OL,8,Fhis 20s whose car was hit in north
OL,9,FLondon and a 60-year-old man in
OL,10,FDumfries and Galloway identified as
OL,11,FRichard Baines, the long-serving
OL,12,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
